      "updated": 1743648514306,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Useful time delays\n\n* L1 cache -------------------------------------------- 0.5ns\n* Branch mispredict --------------------------------- 5 ns\n* L2 cache ================================ 7 ns\n* Mutex lock/unlock ========================= 25 ns\n* Main memory ref .................................................... 100 ns\n* Compress 1KB ........................................................ 10 us\n* Send 1KB on 1Gbps++++++++++++++++++++++++ 10us\n* Read 4KB randomly SSD +++++++++++++++++++ 150 us\n* Read 1MB sequentially from memory ------------ 250 us\n* Round trip within same data center ------------ 500 us\n* Read 1MB sequentially SSD================= 1ms\n* HDD seek ================================ 10 ms\n* Read 1 MB sequentially over 1Gbps..................... 10 ms\n* Read 1 MB sequentially from HDD ...................... 30 ms\n* Send packet CA -> Netherlands -> CA ++++++++ 150 ms",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Useful time delays\n\n* L1 cache -------------------------------------------- 0.5ns\n* Branch mispredict --------------------------------- 5 ns\n* L2 cache ================================ 7 ns\n* Mutex lock/unlock ========================= 25 ns\n* Main memory ref .................................................... 100 ns\n* Compress 1KB ........................................................ 10 us\n* Send 1KB on 1Gbps++++++++++++++++++++++++ 10us\n* Read 4KB randomly SSD +++++++++++++++++++ 150 us\n* Read 1MB sequentially from memory ------------ 250 us\n* Round trip within same data center ------------ 500 us\n* Read 1MB sequentially SSD================= 1ms\n* HDD seek ================================ 10 ms\n* Read 1 MB sequentially over 1Gbps..................... 10 ms\n* Read 1 MB sequentially from HDD ...................... 30 ms\n* Send packet CA -> Netherlands -> CA ++++++++ 150 ms",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
